1 | ∃x (P(x) ∧ Q(x))
  |----
2 | | [a] P(a) ∧ Q(a)
  | |----
3 | | P(a)                      ∧ Elim: 2
4 | | Q(a)                      ∧ Elim: 2
5 | | ∃x P(x)                   ∃ Intro: 3
6 | | ∃x Q(x)                   ∃ Intro: 4
7 | | ∃x P(x) ∧ ∃x Q(x)         ∧ Intro: 5, 6
8 | ∃x P(x) ∧ ∃x Q(x)           ∃ Elim: 1, 2-7
